{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08777","headline":"拟古十二首 七 · 李白","name":"拟古十二首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世路今太行，回车竟何托。\n万族皆凋枯，遂无少可乐。\n旷野多白骨，幽魂共销铄。\n荣贵当及时，春华宜照灼。\n人非崑山玉，安得长璀错。\n身没期不朽，荣名在麟阁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08777.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08777","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}